# Use Custom Widgets First

Before reaching for a built-in Flutter widget, always check `lib/widgets/` for an existing custom alternative.

## Available Custom Widgets

The table below lists known examples — **this is not exhaustive**. Always browse `lib/widgets/` directly before assuming a widget doesn't exist.

| Category | Widget | Use instead of |
|---|---|---|
| **Text** | `NormalText` | `Text` |
| **Text** | `HeadlineText` | `Text` (headings) |
| **Text** | `CenterMessage` | `Center` + `Text` |
| **Text** | `WarningRow` | `Row` + warning `Text` |
| **Text** | `RecognizerText` | `Text` with `TapGestureRecognizer` |
| **Text** | `PrivacyAndTermsLinks` | manual link text |
| **Text** | `WordSeperator` | plain divider text |
| **Input** | `LinkButton` | `TextButton` / `GestureDetector` for links |
| **Input** | `IconOnlyButton` | `IconButton` |
| **Input** | `GoBackButton` | back `IconButton` / `AppBar` leading |
| **Input** | `SignInWithGoogleButton` | custom Google sign-in row |
| **Input** | `SignInWithAppleButton` | custom Apple sign-in row |
| **Wrappers** | `OrientationScaffold` | `Scaffold` |
| **Wrappers** | `SingleButtonHolder` | bare `Column`/`Row` with one button |
| **Wrappers** | `BottomDrawer` | `BottomSheet` |
| **Wrappers** | `ConfirmBottomDrawer` | confirm `BottomSheet` |
| **Shapes** | `LineSeparator` | `Divider` |
| **Background** | `PatternBackground` | plain `Container` background |
| **Functional** | `PopOnOrientationChange` | manual orientation listener |
| **…and more** | See `lib/widgets/` | Always check before using a built-in |

## Examples

```dart
// ❌ BAD
Text('Hello world')
IconButton(onPressed: _back, icon: Icon(Icons.arrow_back))
Scaffold(body: content)
Divider()

// ✅ GOOD
NormalText('Hello world')
GoBackButton()
OrientationScaffold(body: content)
LineSeparator()
```

If no custom widget covers the use case, you may use a Flutter built-in — but first consider whether a new widget should be added to `lib/widgets/`.
